{"seq":1,"slug":"from-script-to-cli","title":"从脚本到 CLI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/progressive-tooling/from-script-to-cli","wordCount":1428,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"从脚本到-cli\">从脚本到 CLI</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>每个优秀的命令行工具都有一个卑微的起点——通常是一个 20 行的 bash 脚本。从脚本到 CLI 的升级不是一个突变，而是一个渐进的过程：当你的脚本开始需要参数、需要帮助信息、需要错误处理时，它就在向你发出&quot;该升级了&quot;的信号。掌握这个升级的时机和方法，是工具匠人的核心技能之一。</p>\n<p>本文将通过一个完整的实例，展示一个脚本如何经历多个里程碑逐步演化为一个规范的 CLI 工具，并提供明确的升级判断标准和每个阶段的技术选型建议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"脚本与-cli-的本质差异\">脚本与 CLI 的本质差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>脚本</th>\n<th>CLI 工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>受众</td>\n<td>自己</td>\n<td>自己 + 他人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口</td>\n<td>硬编码或位置参数</td>\n<td>命名参数 + flags</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td>注释（或无）</td>\n<td><code>--help</code> + man page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>报错就退出</td>\n<td>有意义的错误信息 + 退出码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置</td>\n<td>环境变量或编辑源码</td>\n<td>配置文件 + 参数覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分发</td>\n<td>复制文件</td>\n<td>包管理器安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>手动运行验证</td>\n<td>自动化测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>语义化版本号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"升级信号识别\">升级信号识别</h3><p>以下信号表明你的脚本准备好升级为 CLI 了：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>参数硬编码不够用</strong> — 你开始频繁修改脚本中的常量来适应不同场景</li>\n<li><strong>别人想用</strong> — 同事问你&quot;那个脚本能给我一份吗&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>自己忘了怎么用</strong> — 隔一周回来不记得参数顺序</li>\n<li><strong>出错时一头雾水</strong> — 脚本失败了但看不出原因</li>\n<li><strong>多个变体并存</strong> — 同一个脚本出现了多份略有不同的拷贝</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"cli-工具的分级\">CLI 工具的分级</h3><p>不是所有 CLI 都需要同样的复杂度。根据使用场景分级：</p>\n<p><strong>Level 1 — 个人工具</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>命名参数 + <code>--help</code></li>\n<li>基本错误信息</li>\n<li>一个源文件搞定</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Level 2 — 团队工具</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>配置文件支持</li>\n<li>详细错误信息 + 退出码</li>\n<li>基本测试覆盖</li>\n<li>README 文档</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Level 3 — 公开工具</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>完整的帮助系统</li>\n<li>多平台支持</li>\n<li>自动补全</li>\n<li>包管理器分发</li>\n<li>CI/CD + 发布自动化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"完整演化实例\">完整演化实例</h3><p>让我们跟踪一个工具从脚本到 CLI 的完整演化过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;一次性脚本:硬编码常量&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;开始频繁改常量&quot;| B[&quot;参数化脚本:位置参数&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;记不住参数顺序&quot;| C[&quot;规范 CLI:命名参数 + --help&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;别人想用 / 需要跨平台&quot;| D[&quot;编程语言实现:测试 + 分发&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;要公开发布&quot;| E[&quot;公开工具:补全 + man + 版本管理&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"一次性脚本:硬编码常量\"] --&gt;|\"开始频繁改常量\"| B[\"参数化脚本:位置参数\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"记不住参数顺序\"| C[\"规范 CLI:命名参数 + --help\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"别人想用 / 需要跨平台\"| D[\"编程语言实现:测试 + 分发\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"要公开发布\"| E[\"公开工具:补全 + man + 版本管理\"]</pre><p><strong>起点：一个 15 行的 bash 脚本</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# cleanup-branches: 删除已合并的本地 Git 分支&#10;git branch --merged main | grep -v &quot;main\\|master\\|\\*&quot; | xargs git branch -d&#10;echo &quot;Done! Merged branches cleaned.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cleanup-branches: 删除已合并的本地 Git 分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --merged</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"main\\|master\\|\\*\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Done! Merged branches cleaned.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>问题：硬编码了 main 分支名、没有 dry-run 模式、没有确认步骤。</p>\n<p><strong>第一次升级：添加参数</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# cleanup-branches v0.2: 添加参数支持&#10;set -e&#10;&#10;BASE=&quot;${1:-main}&quot;&#10;DRY_RUN=&quot;${2:-false}&quot;&#10;&#10;BRANCHES=$(git branch --merged &quot;$BASE&quot; | grep -v &quot;$BASE\\|master\\|\\*&quot;)&#10;&#10;if [ -z &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; ]; then&#10;  echo &quot;No merged branches to clean.&quot;&#10;  exit 0&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Branches to remove:&quot;&#10;echo &quot;$BRANCHES&quot;&#10;&#10;if [ &quot;$DRY_RUN&quot; = &quot;true&quot; ] || [ &quot;$DRY_RUN&quot; = &quot;--dry-run&quot; ]; then&#10;  echo &quot;(dry run - no branches deleted)&quot;&#10;  exit 0&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; | xargs git branch -d&#10;echo &quot;Done!&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cleanup-branches v0.2: 添加参数支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">${1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DRY_RUN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">${2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">false</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BRANCHES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --merged</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BASE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BASE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\|master\\|\\*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BRANCHES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"No merged branches to clean.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Branches to remove:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BRANCHES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$DRY_RUN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$DRY_RUN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"--dry-run\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"(dry run - no branches deleted)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BRANCHES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Done!\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>仍然是位置参数——用户必须记住顺序。是时候引入命名参数了。</p>\n<p><strong>第二次升级：命名参数 + 帮助信息</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# cleanup-branches v0.3: proper CLI interface&#10;set -e&#10;&#10;VERSION=&quot;0.3.0&quot;&#10;BASE=&quot;main&quot;&#10;DRY_RUN=false&#10;FORCE=false&#10;&#10;show_help() {&#10;  cat &lt;&lt; EOF&#10;cleanup-branches v$VERSION — Remove merged Git branches&#10;&#10;USAGE:&#10;  cleanup-branches [OPTIONS]&#10;&#10;OPTIONS:&#10;  -b, --base &lt;branch&gt;   Base branch to compare (default: main)&#10;  -d, --dry-run         Show branches without deleting&#10;  -f, --force           Skip confirmation prompt&#10;  -h, --help            Show this help message&#10;  -v, --version         Show version&#10;&#10;EXAMPLES:&#10;  cleanup-branches                    # Clean branches merged into main&#10;  cleanup-branches -b develop         # Clean branches merged into develop&#10;  cleanup-branches --dry-run          # Preview what would be deleted&#10;EOF&#10;}&#10;&#10;while [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do&#10;  case $1 in&#10;    -b|--base) BASE=&quot;$2&quot;; shift 2 ;;&#10;    -d|--dry-run) DRY_RUN=true; shift ;;&#10;    -f|--force) FORCE=true; shift ;;&#10;    -h|--help) show_help; exit 0 ;;&#10;    -v|--version) echo &quot;cleanup-branches v$VERSION&quot;; exit 0 ;;&#10;    *) echo &quot;Unknown option: $1&quot;; show_help; exit 1 ;;&#10;  esac&#10;done&#10;&#10;BRANCHES=$(git branch --merged &quot;$BASE&quot; 2&gt;/dev/null | grep -v &quot;$BASE\\|master\\|\\*&quot; || true)&#10;&#10;if [ -z &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; ]; then&#10;  echo &quot;✓ No merged branches to clean.&quot;&#10;  exit 0&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Branches merged into &#39;$BASE&#39;:&quot;&#10;echo &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; | sed &#39;s/^/  /&#39;&#10;echo &quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;if [ &quot;$DRY_RUN&quot; = true ]; then&#10;  echo &quot;(dry run — no changes made)&quot;&#10;  exit 0&#10;fi&#10;&#10;if [ &quot;$FORCE&quot; = false ]; then&#10;  read -p &quot;Delete these branches? [y/N] &quot; -n 1 -r&#10;  echo&#10;  [[ $REPLY =~ ^[Yy]$ ]] || exit 0&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; | xargs git branch -d&#10;echo &quot;✓ Cleaned $(echo &quot;$BRANCHES&quot; | wc -l | tr -d &#39; &#39;) branches.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cleanup-branches v0.3: proper CLI interface</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.3.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DRY_RUN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FORCE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">show_help</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cleanup-branches v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> — Remove merged Git branches</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">USAGE:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cleanup-branches [OPTIONS]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OPTIONS:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -b, --base &#x3C;branch>   Base branch to compare (default: main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -d, --dry-run         Show branches without deleting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -f, --force           Skip confirmation prompt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -h, --help            Show this help message</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -v, --version         Show version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXAMPLES:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cleanup-branches                    # Clean branches merged into main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cleanup-branches -b develop         # Clean branches merged into develop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cleanup-branches --dry-run          # Preview what would be deleted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1